{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17339","headline":"拜昭陵出城与张秘监阁老同里临行别承在史馆未归寻辱清辞辄酬之 · 权德舆","name":"拜昭陵出城与张秘监阁老同里临行别承在史馆未归寻辱清辞辄酬之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仲月当南吕，晨装拜谷林。\n逢君在东观，不得话离襟。\n策马缘云路，开缄扣玉音。\n还期才浃日，里社酒同斟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}